<title>USA: ATT in deal with Cellular One.</title>
<headline>ATT in deal with Cellular One.</headline>
<dateline>KIRKLAND, Wash. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T's Wireless Data division, and Southwestco Wireless LP, which does business as Cellular One, said they signed an intercarrier agreement expanding the coverage for customers who use their wireless data services.</p>
<p>It said the agreement will allow the carriers to provide Cellular Digital Packet Data (CDPD) services to more than 38.6 million potential customers in more than 20 cellular markets across the United States.</p>
</text>
